// and -O2 (bits 2, 16, 64: a generic `a == b` over i64, `x == y` of two
// i64 and `v.contains(&1)` are right; bits 1, 4, 8, 32 are lost); v0.28.0
// to v0.30.1 the same. A blanket `cmp` or `partial_cmp` instead fails
// inside std (type.ref-value at <std>:5690, <std>:1150), and a blanket
